Don't decend too quickly. I wait until 3rd level before decending to the
second level of the dungeon. Monsters are regenerated, Weapons are
created along with armor and food. Searching helps your casting later
on. In addition to helping casting, you will know what squares to avoid
to not damager your armor/weapons. Try not to exceed decending one level
for every two gained. There's no reason not to take longer. Until you
have around 50hp, you're vulnerable to quite a lot of monsters, even
with negative AC. And *don't* melee floating eyes, leprecauns and
nymphs. 


